WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:07.591
Storage customers want an instant price online, so national self-storage sheds win work local movers could keep.

2
00:00:10.037 --> 00:00:14.691
Mobile and Managed Storage from reloops — your own online storage site, delivered.

3
00:00:16.589 --> 00:00:23.754
For mobile self-storage, customers enter their postcode and film rooms so reloops suggests seven-cubic-metre units.

4
00:00:24.554 --> 00:00:30.784
They choose self-load, loading help, depot loading, or driveway hire, and book online by card.

5
00:00:33.429 --> 00:00:40.829
Or offer managed crate storage, priced per two-hundred-and-fifty cubic foot removals crate each month.

6
00:00:41.279 --> 00:00:48.703
Customers pick items room by room, book collection with optional packing, and get a labelled crate inventory.

7
00:00:49.727 --> 00:00:56.061
Every online booking lands in Requests and returns, ready to schedule straight onto your morning dispatch.

8
00:00:56.751 --> 00:01:05.513
Crews scan the unit QR plate at handover, log its bay on the warehouse map, and customers book returns online.

9
00:01:06.713 --> 00:01:12.841
Each agreement charges the customer's saved card every period, paid straight into your own Stripe account.

10
00:01:13.641 --> 00:01:19.908
Overdue accounts lock release automatically after grace days, turning spare store bays into steady monthly income.

11
00:01:22.385 --> 00:01:29.318
Storage, now delivered. Book a fifteen-minute call at reloops.co to see Storage Hub in action.
